# CSP is set per-page via <meta http-equiv> (Pages _headers appends duplicate CSP
# headers across matching rules, and the browser enforces the intersection, which
# collapsed /community's connect-src to 'none'). /address meta = connect-src 'none';
# /community meta = connect-src 'self'. Non-CSP hardening headers stay here.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
